usage: open-jev-serve [-h] (--checkpoint CHECKPOINT | --model MODEL_ID)
                      [--revision REVISION] [--device DEVICE]
                      [--max-length MAX_LENGTH] [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE]
                      [--backend {torch,triton-tail,fast-cuda}]
                      [--fused-final-head | --no-fused-final-head]
                      [--prefix-cache | --no-prefix-cache] [--host HOST]
                      [--port PORT]

Local HTTP service for Open-Jev; no cloud keys or generated JSON required.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --model MODEL_ID
  --revision REVISION
  --device DEVICE
  --max-length MAX_LENGTH
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
  --backend {torch,triton-tail,fast-cuda}
                        Experimental CUDA acceleration; default torch is
                        unchanged
  --fused-final-head, --no-fused-final-head
                        Fuse final RMSNorm and scalar scoring in fast-cuda
                        (default on)
  --prefix-cache, --no-prefix-cache
                        Enable request-local token-prefix reuse; default off
                        pending full-checkpoint BF16 validation
  --host HOST
  --port PORT
